UPDATE companies SET description='York Metal Fabricators, Inc. has operated from Oklahoma City, Oklahoma since its founding in 1963 by Leon and Evelyn York. The company remains family-owned and operated, building a reputation in the non-ferrous handrail industry through a customized approach to each project.

The shop specializes in custom ornamental railings, fabricating from aluminum, stainless steel, bronze, wood, and glass. With no catalog of standard rail systems, the team builds to meet each design intent, coordinating with partners to deliver full metal packages for architectural projects.

Primary customers include architects, designers, general contractors, and steel companies seeking a fabrication partner for railing and ornamental metalwork. The firm has collaborated with the design community since its inception and works directly with build teams on project execution, as well as supplying steel companies with finished components.

