UPDATE companies SET description='180 Medical is headquartered in Albuquerque, New Mexico. The company was founded in 2002 by Todd Brown after a spinal cord injury gave him firsthand experience with the difficulties of obtaining quality catheter supplies. Brown started the business from his garage with the goal of providing better product options and support for people facing similar challenges.

Today the company operates as a nationwide supplier of intermittent catheters and ostomy products, carrying selections from multiple brands. The company reports serving over 100,000 customers across the United States and has accumulated more than 13,000 five-star reviews on Trustpilot over its 24-year history.

