UPDATE companies SET description='24 South Apparel is a family-owned and operated custom apparel shop based in Boise, Idaho.

Garments are sourced in 100% cotton, cotton-poly blends, polyester, and tri-blend fabrics, printed with plastisol or water-based inks. Turnaround is quoted at 14 days from art approval, with local pickup or delivery available in Boise and shipping offered nationwide.

Customers range from corporate teams needing branded polos and bags to schools, churches, bands, sports leagues, and family reunions ordering custom t-shirts, hoodies, hats, and tote bags. The company also produces vinyl signage such as window wraps and banners for promotional use.

