UPDATE companies SET description='A & I Distributors is headquartered in Mandan, North Dakota, and traces its roots to 1924 when Frank Stanaway founded the business in Butte, Montana. Now in its fourth generation, the company remains family- and employee-owned, operating nine warehouse locations across eight states in the Northwestern United States.

The firm distributes lubricants, coolants, diesel exhaust fluid, filtration products, service chemicals, and related equipment to automotive, commercial, and industrial customers. Beyond product supply, it provides sales, repair, and installation services for automotive and commercial lifts, lube equipment, tire equipment, and flush machines. Its distribution network covers more than 20,000 square miles, supported by an online customer portal for ordering and account management.

Its product lineup includes name-brand lubricants and coolants tailored for applications ranging from service drives to heavy industrial mills.

