UPDATE companies SET description='A & J Manufacturing Co. operates from Foothill Ranch, California, producing aluminum equipment enclosures, racks, and cabinets for demanding environments.

The company manufactures a range of equipment racks including the AJXR 100 Series light-duty racks, AJM 150 Series medium-duty racks, and AJMR/AJSR 159 Series heavy-duty racks, along with console systems and custom enclosures. All products feature ruggedized, modular aluminum construction and conform to MIL-S-901D Grade A shock and vibration qualifications. A & J also supplies a full range of installation kits and accessories, and offers engineering design support, quality assurance, and configure-to-order manufacturing.

A & J serves defense contractors, utility providers, energy firms, correctional facilities, and mission-critical communication operators. Customers have included Southwest Research Institute for submarine platform enclosures, Moog, DRS Technologies for shipboard racks, Cutlass Associates for prison security systems, and a mission-critical communication provider that reduced implementation time through custom shipping solutions.

The company emphasizes its MIL-S-901D Grade A qualification, in-house engineering support for custom configurations, and a configure-to-order model that works from standard EIA openings. Testimonials highlight on-time delivery, dimensional accuracy, and the ability to integrate custom logistics such as direct-to-next-supplier shipping crates.', certifications=ARRAY['MIL-SPEC','MIL-S-901D Grade A']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Equipment rack manufacturing", "Enclosure fabrication", "Custom enclosure design", "Console system manufacturing", "Installation kit assembly", "Engineering design support", "Quality assurance", "Configure-to-order manufacturing", "Shock and vibration testing (MIL-S-901D)", "Technical drawing library"], "industries": ["Defense", "Utility", "Energy", "Correctional facilities", "Mission critical communications", "Submarine platforms", "Shipboard electronics"], "materials": ["Aluminum"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["MIL-S-901D Grade A qualified for shock and vibration", "Modular aluminum construction for COTS and custom designs", "In-house engineering support for custom configurations", "Configure-to-order flexibility with standard EIA openings", "Proven on-time delivery for defense and critical infrastructure"], "facts_used": ["Company name: A & J Manufacturing Co. -> db", "Location: Foothill Ranch, California -> db", "Description: Aluminum equipment enclosures/racks/cabinets for utility, defense, energy sectors -> db", "Certifications: MIL-SPEC -> db", "Product lines: AJXR 100 Series, AJM 150 Series, AJMR/AJSR 159 Series, Console Systems, Custom Enclosures, Kits & Accessories -> /", "Standards: MIL-S-901D Grade A Qualified, Standard EIA Openings -> /", "Services: Engineering Support, Quality Assurance, Configure To Order -> /", "Customers: Southwest Research Institute, Moog, DRS Technologies, Cutlass Associates, Mission Critical Communication Provider -> /", "Industries: defense, utility