UPDATE companies SET description='A1 Metal Fabrication operates from Rogers, Arkansas, founded by Brock and Graham, who grew up taking on custom fabrication jobs before working across North America as combination pipe welders and on structural red‑iron buildings and broadcast‑station projects. The pair launched the shop to apply their perfection‑based mindset to every project.

