UPDATE companies SET description='AKG North American Operations, doing business as AKG of America, is headquartered in Mitchell, South Dakota. The facility serves as the North American arm of the AKG Group, a global thermal management specialist with a century of industry experience. While the exact founding year of the U.S. operation is not publicly disclosed, the group’s history spans 100 years of heat exchanger development.

